OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAKing could help cities keep status
OL,4,Aafter council shake-up
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe King could be involved in the
OL,7,Fprocess of ensuring Preston and
OL,8,FLancaster do not lose their status as
OL,9,Fcities when the councils for the two
OL,10,Fareas are abolished.
OL,12,FThe Local Democracy Reporting Service
OL,13,Fsaid officials in both places have been
OL,14,Ftold the status is likely to be
OL,15,Fprotected by letters patent, legal
OL,16,Fdocuments authorised by King Charles
OL,17,FIII.
OL,19,FThe two cities are expected to become
OL,20,Fpart of larger councils in 2029, a
OL,21,Fchange that could otherwise result in
OL,22,Fthe titles being surrendered.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
